@startuml
' Frontier exploration sequence diagram for current Hiwonder/Nav2 stack
' 주의: 초기 프로토타입(ExplorerNode/HazardMapNode) 기준 다이어그램.
' 두 클래스 다 commit eb9eaab 에서 삭제됨 — 지금은 frontier_exploration_ros2
' + state_manager/mission_executor/vision_detector/fire_keepout_node 로 대체됨.

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

title UNCC Frontier 기반 탐사 시퀀스\nSLAM + Global/Local Costmap + Hazard Map + Nav2

actor "환경" as Env
participant "LD19 / Robot\n(/scan_raw, /odom, TF)" as Robot
participant "SLAM Toolbox" as Slam
participant "Global Costmap" as GCost
participant "Local Costmap" as LCost
participant "Perception" as Perception
participant "HazardMapNode" as Hazard
participant "ExplorerNode" as Explorer
participant "FrontierDetector" as FD
participant "PriorityCalculator" as PC
participant "Nav2Navigator" as Nav
participant "PlannerServer" as Planner
participant "BtNavigator" as BT
participant "ControllerServer" as Controller
participant "VelocitySmoother" as Smoother

== 세계 모델 갱신 ==
Env -> Robot : LiDAR / robot motion
Robot -> Slam : /scan_raw + odom->base TF
Slam -> Slam : scan matching / pose graph
Slam --> Explorer : /map
Slam --> GCost : live /map
Robot --> GCost : /scan_raw + TF
Robot --> LCost : /scan_raw + TF
GCost --> Explorer : global costmap
LCost --> Explorer : local costmap

opt 화재/사람/위험 인식 결과가 있음
  Perception -> Hazard : PerceptionInfo
  Hazard -> Hazard : map frame으로 투영\n위험도 spread + decay
  Hazard --> Explorer : /hazard_map
end

== 탐사 주기 ==
loop exploration timer (예: 1~2 Hz)
  Explorer -> Explorer : TF(map -> base_footprint)로 robotPose 갱신
  Explorer -> FD : detectFrontierCells(currentMap)
  FD -> FD : FREE-UNKNOWN 경계 검출
  FD -> FD : connected-component clustering
  FD -> FD : cluster별 안전한 goalPose 계산
  FD --> Explorer : frontier candidates

  alt frontier가 없음
    Explorer -> Explorer : explorationComplete = true
    note right of Explorer
      종료 조건 예시
      - frontier 없음
      - frontier 총 면적 임계값 이하
      - 모든 후보가 반복 실패
    end note
  else 후보 존재
    loop 각 Frontier 후보
      Explorer -> FD : calculateInformationGain(frontier)
      FD --> Explorer : informationGain

      Explorer -> Nav : calculatePathCost(goalPose)
      Nav -> Planner : ComputePathToPose(goalPose)

      alt 경로 없음 / planner 실패
        Planner --> Nav : failure
        Nav --> Explorer : unreachable
        Explorer -> Explorer : 후보 제거 또는 failurePenalty 증가
      else 경로 존재
        Planner --> Nav : Path
        Nav --> Explorer : reachable + navigationCost

        Explorer -> PC : calculateScore(frontier, globalCostmap, hazardMap)
        PC -> PC : globalCost / narrowness 계산
        PC -> PC : hazardRisk / missionValue 계산
        PC --> Explorer : score
      end
    end

    Explorer -> Explorer : 최고 score Frontier 선택

    == Nav2 목표 전송 ==
    Explorer -> Nav : sendGoal(bestFrontier.goalPose)
    Nav -> BT : NavigateToPose
    BT -> Planner : global path 계획 / 재계획
    Planner --> BT : global path
    BT -> Controller : FollowPath

    loop 목표 도달 전
      Controller -> Smoother : /cmd_vel_nav
      Smoother -> Robot : /cmd_vel
      Robot -> Slam : 새 /scan_raw + odometry/TF
      Robot -> GCost : 새 obstacle observation
      Robot -> LCost : 새 obstacle observation
      Slam --> Explorer : 갱신된 /map
      GCost --> Explorer : 갱신 global costmap
      LCost --> Explorer : 갱신 local costmap
      Hazard --> Explorer : 갱신 hazard map

      Explorer -> Explorer : local safety 검사

      alt local costmap이 막힘 또는 hazardRisk가 임계값 초과
        Explorer -> Nav : cancelGoal()
        Nav -> BT : Cancel NavigateToPose
        Explorer -> Explorer : failurePenalty++\n현재 목표 blacklist/쿨다운
        break 재탐색
      else 진행 가능
        Controller -> Controller : local path tracking
      end
    end

    alt 목표 도달 성공
      BT --> Nav : SUCCEEDED
      Nav --> Explorer : navigation result
      Explorer -> Explorer : frontier 방문 완료 처리
      note right of Explorer
        즉시 다음 frontier를 고정하지 않고
        새 /map 기준으로 다시 frontier 탐색.
      end note
    else 목표 실패
      BT --> Nav : ABORTED / CANCELED
      Nav --> Explorer : navigation result
      Explorer -> Explorer : failurePenalty 증가\n재탐색
    end
  end
end

note over Explorer,PC
권장 score

+ InformationGain
+ MissionValue (fire/person hint 등)
- NavigationCost
- HazardRisk
- GlobalCost
- Narrowness
- FailurePenalty

Local Costmap은 먼 frontier의 점수보다
"현재 이동을 계속할 수 있는가" 판단에 더 적합.
end note

note over Slam,GCost
온라인 SLAM 탐사에서는
SLAM Toolbox가 map -> odom을 담당하므로
AMCL의 map -> odom TF를 동시에 켜지 않는 것이 중요.
end note

@enduml
